<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40302" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quot-quŏt</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>adj. indecl.</i> [quot]. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i>how many soever</i>,
				<i>as many soever as</i> (class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">si leges duae aut si plures aut quotquot erunt
					conservari non possint,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. Inv. 2, 49, 145</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Cat. 42, 1</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quotquot eunt dies,</span>”
				i. e. <i>daily</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Hor.
					C. 2, 14, 5</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quotquot sunt,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					S. 2, 7, 14</span></i>
			.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>all</i>, <i>every</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quoquot annis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. L. L. 5, § 40</span></i>
			 Müll. al.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mensibus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					ib. 5</span></i>
			, § 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">47 ib. (al. quot mensibus): quotquot enim
					promissiones Dei sunt, in illo est,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg. 2
					Cor. 1, 20</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
